{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10610030","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10610030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"narration:0:1061003001:2":{"text":"배에 오르자마자 나츠는 초점을 잃은 눈으로 계속 싸워야 한다고 중얼거렸다...","source_cn":"一上船，纳兹就双眸失神，但嘴里还念叨着要战斗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C5AED47290B47A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1061003002:0":{"text":"나츠, 정신 차려!","source_cn":"纳兹，你振作一点！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9C9A600EF01F4F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1061003003:0":{"text":"윽, 루시... 루시가 잔뜩 있어...","source_cn":"呃、露西……好多露西！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x056DBB0325B046E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1061003004:1":{"text":"곧 바다 드래곤이 나타난다는 해역이야. 조금만 더 버티라고.","source_cn":"就快驶进有海龙的海域了，再坚持一下吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5315C8C6ABC1174C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1061003005:1":{"text":"저, 저 배가 우리한테 대포를 쏘고 있어!","source_cn":"有、有船在炮轰我们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB047CD9530774499","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1061003006:1":{"text":"걱정 마. 신밧드 선장이 있잖아? 두고 보라고. 박살내줄 테니까!","source_cn":"不用担心，有辛巴达船长在。等着吧，看我撞飞他们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C42FBEFCF4A6630","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1061003007:0":{"text":"피, 피하는 게 아니라 박살을 내겠다고?!!","source_cn":"什么，不是甩开而是撞飞吗？！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DCC05B3735976B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:15:1061003008:0":{"text":"큰 소리와 함께 신밧드는 우리를 노리던 배를 들이박아 큰 구멍을 냈다...","source_cn":"一声巨响后，辛巴达开船把炮轰我们的船撞了个大洞……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7CA14282905C900","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1061003009:0":{"text":"걱정 마! 저번에 바다 몬스터에게 당한 후로 후긴이 선체를 보강해 줬거든. 아무리 맞아도 끄떡없어.","source_cn":"别怕，上次被海怪袭击后，我特意找呼金加固了船体，我们的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x539922AF23C63FB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1061003010:1":{"text":"저쪽 배에서 놈들이 튀어 나왔군! 지금이야. 귀찮은 녀석들을 처리해! 난 선수를 맡을 테니, 갑판은 너희에게 맡길게!","source_cn":"那艘船上的人跳上来了！趁现在，把碍事的人干掉吧，我盯着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FE81AF30B0CBBEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1061003011:1":{"text":"나츠... 나츠! 일어나. 싸워야 해!","source_cn":"纳兹……纳兹！醒醒，要战斗了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4770ED3801895A8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1061003012:1":{"text":"... ","source_cn":"…………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70646B5D874C111A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1061003013:0":{"text":"쯧. 이 친구는 완전 뻗어버렸네.","source_cn":"啧，这小子已经晕船到不省人事了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35C5807890F12767","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1061003014:0":{"text":"그럼 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>에게 부탁할 수밖에.","source_cn":"那就拜托<style=stress><player_n...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA6B2E7E680C2F18D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그럼 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>에게 부탁할 수밖에.","female":"그럼 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>에게 부탁할 수밖에.","variant_male_record_index":"103629","variant_female_record_index":"103630","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1061003015:0":{"text":"거기, 배 위에 있는 놈들! 우린 버루트 님의 명령을 받고 이 해역을 봉쇄하고 있다! 드래곤을 사냥하려는 놈들은 썩 물러나! 그리고 값나가는 물건은 다 내놓고 꺼져라!","source_cn":"船上的听着！我们受伯特兰老爷的命令，封锁这片海域！任何...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C6A9EEBA4F1EF70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1061003016:0":{"text":"이 자식들이! 돈 내놔, 배에 구멍낸 값도 받아내야겠다!","source_cn":"他奶奶的！不交钱！撞船这事没完！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8357DB402D660FDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1061003017:0":{"text":"얘들아, 덮쳐라! 보이는 건 다 쓸어와!","source_cn":"小的们，冲！看到什么拿什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA76AA8C0D979CBF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1061003018:0":{"text":"네!!!","source_cn":"是！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A09702C3999EBD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:32:1061003018":{"text":"네!!!","source_cn":"是！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A09702C3999EBD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1061003019:1":{"text":"두, 두목... 잘못 걸린 것 같습니다!","source_cn":"头儿……！碰到硬茬了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77C3EFB2ED597E7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1061003020:0":{"text":"멈춰라! 안 그러면 이 여자 목숨은 없어!","source_cn":"住手！不然我就要她的命！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x767E6347E80511E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1061003021:1":{"text":"...루시!","source_cn":"……露西！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BD8E35767A42874","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1061003022:0":{"text":"저기, 뒤로 돌아서 기습하려고 했는데 실패했어...","source_cn":"那个，我想绕到后面偷袭，但失算了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21CD715FBA77D93D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1061003023:0":{"text":"헤헤, 이 여자 목숨이 아까우면 가진 걸 다 내놔!","source_cn":"嘿嘿，不想让她受伤的话就把钱交出来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x336E346BE3C90912","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1061003024:0":{"text":"후... <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 저 친구 마법사라며? 왜 반격을 안 하는 거야?","source_cn":"呼……<style=stress><player_na...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x39FF372E9ECA6106","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"후... <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 저 친구 마법사라며? 왜 반격을 안 하는 거야?","female":"후... <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 저 친구 마법사라며? 왜 반격을 안 하는 거야?","variant_male_record_index":"103642","variant_female_record_index":"103643","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1061003025:0":{"text":"성령마도사라니까! 하지만 지금 가지고 있는 성령 열쇠로는... 부를 수 있는 성령이 없어...","source_cn":"我是星灵魔导士！可我……我只带了一把星灵之钥……能召唤...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35AA80A4523F1D41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1061003026:0":{"text":"어이쿠, 아가씨. 움직이지 마. 내 칼에는 눈이 안 달려 있거든.","source_cn":"喔哟，小姑娘不要乱动哦，我的刀可不长眼睛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3210D20FBCBDFF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1061003027:0":{"text":"화룡의...","source_cn":"火龙的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95741B0B7FAB5696","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1061003028:0":{"text":"뭐야! 네놈, 언제 거기까지?","source_cn":"啊，你是什么时候冒出来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E0C446F983E81FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1061003029:1":{"text":"화룡의 포... 우웩!","source_cn":"火龙的咆……呕！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB025A20EE726E94D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1061003030:0":{"text":"별거 아니었잖아? 저리 꺼져!","source_cn":"原来是个软脚虾，滚一边去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFABEA710016C5FEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1061003031:0":{"text":"젠장... 루시에게서 손 떼!","source_cn":"可恶……不许！不许伤害露西！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C8847B2CF0C4039","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1061003032:1":{"text":"나츠! 나츠를 해치지 마!","source_cn":"纳兹！不许你们动他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB46B18DBB2915CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1061003033:1":{"text":"아쿠에리아스! 근처에 있다면, 내 목소리를 들어줘. 여기로 와줘!","source_cn":"阿葵亚！如果你在附近，请聆听我的呼唤，现身吧！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BEC3130B22FD782","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:59:1061003034:1":{"text":"잿빛 하늘 아래, 바다를 가르며 엄청난 물보라가 솟구쳤다...!","source_cn":"阴沉的天空下，海面卷起了骇人的风浪……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x290B6F9E2F37DEC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:62:1061003035:1":{"text":"이건... 이건 뭔가 이상해! 바다 드래곤, 바다 드래곤이 나타났다! 다들 도망쳐!","source_cn":"风浪……这风浪不对！是海龙！海龙出来了！快跑！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C06EE5981C308A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:64:1061003036:0":{"text":"어이쿠, 바다 드래곤을 잡으러 온 거 아니었어? 바다 드래곤이 나타나니까 왜 다들 도망치지?","source_cn":"哟，你们不是来猎龙的吗？怎么海龙出来就要逃了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x441245BDCDB34113","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:65:1061003037:0":{"text":"얼른 도망가라고. 아니면 바다 드래곤이 쫓아간다~","source_cn":"跑快点啊，海龙要追上你们喽！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC135DAFDBADC2BA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:67:1061003038:0":{"text":"신밧드의 장난 섞인 말 한마디에, 해적들은 겁에 질려 우르르 물 속으로 뛰어들었다...","source_cn":"在辛巴达的调侃下，海盗们像下饺子一样争先恐后跳入水中……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3410AE88CED4DE37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:69:1061003039:0":{"text":"간이 콩알만 하네... 여기서 러스트 항까지 헤엄쳐 가려면 한참 걸릴 텐데. 파도와 표류의 신께서 보살펴주셔야겠는걸?","source_cn":"真是不禁吓啊……从这里游回锈锚港恐怕够呛，愿风浪与漂泊...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x400C8662FCFD3EB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:70:1061003039":{"text":"간이 콩알만 하네... 여기서 러스트 항까지 헤엄쳐 가려면 한참 걸릴 텐데. 파도와 표류의 신께서 보살펴주셔야겠는걸?","source_cn":"真是不禁吓啊……从这里游回锈锚港恐怕够呛，愿风浪与漂泊之神保佑他们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x400C8662FCFD3EB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:72:1061003040:0":{"text":"...루시?","source_cn":"……露西？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92015C9EE7293C8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:75:1061003041:1":{"text":"아쿠에리아스! 다행이다. 드디어 찾았어!","source_cn":"阿葵亚！太好了，找到你了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE30692F3036936D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:76:1061003042:1":{"text":"몇 번을 말해? 내 휴가를 방해하지 마!","source_cn":"说过多少次了，不要来打扰我的假期！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DA62AB8EF738AFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:77:1061003043:0":{"text":"기분 전환을 하러 온 거야? 네 성령의 문이 여기로 연결된 이유가 있었구나... 근데 왜 난 널 불러내지 못한 거야?","source_cn":"你是来散心的吗？怪不得召唤你的星灵之门通向了这里……但...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5ACE726BEFE47D38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:78:1061003044:0":{"text":"기분 전환이라고 할 수 있지. 우연히 어떤 힘에 의해서 여기로 오게 되었는데, 풍경도 좋아서 그냥 여기 계속 있었어.","source_cn":"算是散心吧，我无意间被某种力量传送到这里，没想到这里风...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E48760C8276B261","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:79:1061003045:0":{"text":"역시 무슨 일이 있었던 거구나! 아쿠에리아스, 넌 정말 강하지만, 그래도 난 항상 널 걱정해. 그렇지 않으면 여기까지 따라오지도 않았을 거야...","source_cn":"果然是出了意外！虽然阿葵亚很强，但我还是担心你，就跟着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57EDD62D247D80EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:80:1061003046:0":{"text":"...흥, 쓸데없는 걱정은 여전하구나.","source_cn":"……哼，还是那么爱多管闲事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65D4E0BE054056A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:83:1061003047:0":{"text":"그럼 혹시 해적들이 말했던 바다 드래곤이 너였어? 와, 드래곤보다 건장한 인어는 처음 보는데!","source_cn":"所以海盗们在找的海龙就是你？哇，第一次见到比海龙还要强...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x623E848D40F7D927","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:84:1061003048:1":{"text":"...건장하다고?","source_cn":"……强壮？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC399ED8DFB27ADA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:85:1061003049:0":{"text":"아니, 그... 강하다고!","source_cn":"……是强大！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD5F8079B0D6B0C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:88:1061003050:0":{"tex