","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:96:1061003055:1":{"text":"못 해! 하지만... 꼬르륵...","source_cn":"不会，但是——咕噜噜！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26D852231D3BDD89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:97:1061003056:0":{"text":"수영도 못하면서 바다에 뛰어들다니, 진짜 용감한 친구네.","source_cn":"这妹子，不会也跳下海了，真勇敢啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06BF5364DC8CAEA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:98:1061003055":{"text":"못 해! 하지만... 꼬르륵...","source_cn":"不会，但是——咕噜噜！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26D852231D3BDD89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:99:1061003057:0":{"text":"아, 그래. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 말이 맞아. 닻을 내려줘. 내가 가서 둘 다 건져올게!","source_cn":"啊，说的对，<style=stress><player...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3D35FCB7C8883031","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아, 그래. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 말이 맞아. 닻을 내려줘. 내가 가서 둘 다 건져올게!","female":"아, 그래. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 말이 맞아. 닻을 내려줘. 내가 가서 둘 다 건져올게!","variant_male_record_index":"103679","variant_female_record_index":"103680","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:98:0:1":{"text":"빨리 구해야겠는데","source_cn